    "note": "Instruction edit of one source image (D-031, fixed in Build V3). Mirrors the official ComfyUI 2511 template: the source is the reference image of TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus (vision tokens + reference latent), FluxKontextMultiReferenceLatentMethod index_timestep_zero, CFGNorm, and a FULL denoise. The VAE-encoded source only sets the latent size; a partial denoise of it on the 4-step Lightning schedule reproduced the source (measured 2026-09-17, coordination/build-v3/img.md). `denoise` is chosen by the router from the edit mode and strength, never 1:1 from the caller. lightning_strength 0 plus steps/cfg selects the true-CFG quality path. Adapter ScottzillaSystems/qwen-image-edit-plus-nsfw-lora @66e89e9 is a Qwen-Image-family LoRA, NOT an exact 2511 match; applied only when adapter_strength > 0.",
